   \]
   Simplifying further:
   \[
   \sqrt{3} - r\sqrt{3} = 2r
   \]
   \[
   \sqrt{3} = 2r + r\sqrt{3}
   \]
   \[
   \sqrt{3} = r(2 + \sqrt{3})
