\]  
The acceleration \( v \) is given by:  
\[
v = \frac{I}{\mu} = \frac{835 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{N}}{1.67 \times 10^{-27} \, \text{kg}} \approx 999 \, \text{m/s}^2
\]  
