- \( x(t) \) is the displacement of the object at time \( t \)
- \( A \) is the amplitude of the oscillation
- \( \omega \) is the angular frequency of the oscillation
- \( \phi \) is the phase shift of the oscillation
- \( x_0 \) is the initial position of the object

- \( \varphi \) is the phase shift of the damping term

